   Pezzulo, Alejandro A.; Hornick, Emma E.; Rector, Michael V.; Estin, Miriam; Reisetter, Anna C.; Taft, Peter J.; Carter, A. Brent; Stoltz, David A.; Zabner, Joseph, Univ Iowa, Dept Internal Med, Carver Coll Med, Iowa City, IA 52242 USA.
   Manak, J. Robert, Univ Iowa, Dept Pediat, Carver Coll Med, Iowa City, IA 52242 USA.
   Butcher, Stephen C.; Manak, J. Robert, Univ Iowa, Dept Biol, Iowa City, IA 52242 USA.
   Carter, A. Brent, Univ Iowa, Free Rad \& Radiat Biol Program, Iowa City, IA USA.},
